
Algorithm MERGE(L1, L2)

Step 1: Start.

Step 2: Create an empty result list.
        Set head = NULL and tail = NULL.

Step 3: While L1 != NULL and L2 != NULL:

    a. If L1.data <= L2.data:
          Select the node from L1.
          Move L1 to L1.next.

    b. Otherwise:
          Select the node from L2.
          Move L2 to L2.next.

    c. Attach the selected node to the
       end of the result list.

Step 4: If L1 != NULL, attach the remaining
        nodes of L1 to the result list.

Step 5: If L2 != NULL, attach the remaining
        nodes of L2 to the result list.

Step 6: Display the merged list.

Step 7: Stop.
